BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 184.5 Td (The **Inter-Company Transactions** app transforms ERPNext into a multi-entity) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 173.0 Td (conglomerate platform. It solves four foundational challenges in group corporate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 161.5 Td (accounting:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 150.0 Td (1. **Double Data Entry:** When Entity A sells goods to Entity B, Entity B's purchase) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 138.5 Td (order/receipt/invoice is created automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 127.0 Td (2. **Transfer Pricing Non-Compliance:** Dynamically computes markups, resale prices,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 115.5 Td (and arm's-length benchmarks across tax jurisdictions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 104.0 Td (3. **Liquidity Friction:** Consolidates multiple reciprocal invoices into single) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 92.5 Td (minimal multilateral netting settlements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 81.0 Td (4. **Group Financial Consolidation:** Eliminates internal double-counting of AR/AP,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 69.5 Td (sales, and COGS for parent holding companies.) Tj ET
Q
